00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:30.180
Amen.

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:16.200
I think it's time you went to bed, sweetheart.

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:17.560
Just a minute, Mommy.

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:20.380
I want to finish this thank you letter to Santa Claus.

00:23:20.680 --> 00:23:21.440
Thank you letter?

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:22.720
Oh, Santa's going to like that.

00:23:22.900 --> 00:23:24.060
That's very thoughtful of you.

00:23:30.310 --> 00:23:37.280
There now, it's all finished.

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:40.730
I hope Santa can read first grade writing.

00:23:41.050 --> 00:23:42.170
Oh, I'm sure he can.

00:23:43.280 --> 00:23:46.680
Daddy, I told you Santa would give Mommy your voice back.

00:23:48.100 --> 00:23:48.300
Yeah.

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:50.920
Well, you were right, sweetie.

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:53.280
Christmas is the season for miracles, huh?
